{c: Verse 1}
[F] Ye chaand saa roshan chehra,        [C] julfon kaa rang sunaharaa
[F] Ye jheel see neeli aankhein,        [C] koi raaz hain in mein geharaa
[F] Taareef karu kya uski,        jisne [C] tumhe [F] banaayaa
Ye chaand saa roshan chehra...        [F] Ek cheej qayaamat bhee hai,
[C] logon se sunaa kar [A#] te [F] the,        [F] Tumhe dekh ke maine maanaa,
[C] wo thik kahaa kar [A#] te [F] the,        [C] wo thik [A#] kahaa [F] karte the
[F] Hai chaal mein teree jaalim,        [C] kuchh ayesee balaa kaa jaadoo
[F] Sau baar sanbhaalaa dil ko,        [C] par ho ke rahaa bekaaboo
[F] Taareef karu kyaa us kee,        jis ne tumhe banaayaa
[F] Har subah kiran kee laayee,        [C] hain rang tere gaa [A#] lon kaa
[A#] Har shaam kee chaadar kaalee,        saayaa [A#] hain tere baalon kaa
[F] Tu balakhaatee yek nadiyaan,        [C] har mauj teree angadaee
[F] Jo in maujo mein doobaa,        [C] us ne hee duniyaan paayee
[F] Taareef karu kyaa us kee,        jis ne tumhe banaayaa
